<title>AUSTRALIA: Biggest gains/falls for ASX 100 index in last week.</title>
<headline>Biggest gains/falls for ASX 100 index in last week.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is a list of the 10 largest gaining and falling stocks for Australian companies included in the Australian Stock Exchange's ASX 100 index for the week to August 1.</p>
<p>Top 10 largest gains in week</p>
<p>Rank Name			  Price     pct change</p>
<p> 1  Goldfields		   1.74	  24.29</p>
<p> 2  Great Central		2.78	  11.65</p>
<p> 3  Plutonic Rsc		 4.00	  11.42</p>
<p> 4  Goodman Fielder	    2.10	  11.11</p>
<p> 5  Orogen Minerals	    3.95	   8.22</p>
<p> 6  Lihir Gold		   1.98	   8.20</p>
<p> 7  Caltex Aust		  4.80	   7.87</p>
<p> 8  Oil Search		   4.16	   7.49</p>
<p> 9  Aust Foundation	    2.80	   6.87</p>
<p>10  QNI Ltd			2.50	   6.84</p>
<p>Top 10 largest falls in week</p>
<p>Rank Name			  Price     pct change</p>
<p> 1  Davids Limited	     0.89	 -19.82</p>
<p> 2  Sthn Pac Pete		3.51	  -7.63</p>
<p> 3  Futuris Corp		 2.00	  -5.66</p>
<p> 4  Pioneer Intl		 4.82	  -3.98</p>
<p> 5  Qantas			 3.00	  -3.85</p>
<p> 6  Howard Smith		13.15	  -3.45</p>
<p> 7  CSR			    5.16	  -2.64</p>
<p> 8  Tabcorp Holdings	   6.70	  -2.47</p>
<p> 9  Village Road-Pr	    3.55	  -2.47</p>
<p>10  Pasminco		     2.53	  -2.32</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373-1800</p>
